            # bias form cannot round are odd integers above 2**22 -- a band
            # bf16 cannot represent (its mantissa step there is 2**15).  So the
            # bare bias is exact for both, with no select at all.
            return (x + _ROUND_BIAS) - _ROUND_BIAS
