            # definition, one op instead of two rounding ops plus a select.  A
            # cast is only defined inside the integer range, so the guard keeps
            # the operand wherever the cast is not: at or above the magnitude
            # where the mantissa step reaches 1 (every value there is already
            # integral) and for the non-finite ones.
